The internal AF3 adapter includes modified code from AlphaFold3 Hallucination
(Copyright 2026 AlphaFold3 Hallucination Contributors, Apache-2.0), formerly
published at https://github.com/Terry-Wang-Lynx/AlphaFold3-Hallucination.
This is a source attribution, not an installation dependency. The adapted
source is included in src/hallucination_lab/backends/_af3/.
Changes include general design masks, caller-supplied objectives, explicit
output capabilities, and a separate optimization engine.

The AF3 Evoformer adapter derives from AlphaFold 3 (Google DeepMind,
Apache-2.0), source b2f3d45fbfcacc5183bd5345d15df93571b8437f.
https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold3
Its parameter names and module structure are retained for compatibility.
The optional Soft Atom encoder adapts AF3 3.0.3 reference-atom attention
with probability-weighted native layouts and the original parameter names.

Sequence relaxation and the optional AF2 backend use ColabDesign semantics.
